#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Introduction to primitives {#introduction-to-primitives}"
msgstr "Panimula sa mga primitive {#introduction-to-primitives}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Primitives were created to simplify the most common tasks for quantum "
"computers: namely, sampling quantum states and calculating expectation "
"values. The first Qiskit Runtime primitives "
"([`EstimatorV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-"
"runtime/estimator-v2) and "
"[`SamplerV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-"
"runtime/sampler-v2)) are implementations of the Qiskit [primitives base "
"classes](/guides/primitives). They provide a more sophisticated "
"implementation (for example, by including error mitigation) as a cloud-based"
" service and are used to access IBM Quantum&reg; hardware.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang mga primitive ay nilikha para gawing mas simple ang mga pinakakaraniwang"
" gawain para sa mga quantum computer: ang pag-sample ng mga quantum state at"
" pagkalkula ng mga expectation value. Ang unang Qiskit Runtime primitive "
"([`EstimatorV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-"
"runtime/estimator-v2) at "
"[`SamplerV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-"
"runtime/sampler-v2)) ay mga implementasyon ng Qiskit [primitives base "
"classes](/guides/primitives). Nagbibigay sila ng mas sopistikadong "
"implementasyon (halimbawa, sa pamamagitan ng pagsasama ng error mitigation) "
"bilang isang cloud-based na serbisyo at ginagamit para ma-access ang IBM "
"Quantum&reg; hardware.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The newest Qiskit Runtime primitive, "
"[Executor](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/executor) "
"(which is in beta), provides a lower-level interface that gives more "
"visibility and control without sacrificing performance.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang pinakabagong Qiskit Runtime primitive, "
"[Executor](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/executor) (na"
" nasa beta pa), ay nagbibigay ng mas mababang antas ng interface na "
"nagbibigay ng mas maraming visibility at kontrol nang hindi sinisasakripisyo"
" ang performance.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<CardGroup>\n"
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Estimator\"\n"
"      description=\"Computes the expectation values for one or more observables with respect to states prepared by quantum circuits.  Has built-in error suppression and mitigation methods.\"\n"
"      href=\"/guides/get-started-with-estimator\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Estimator quickstart\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Estimator quickstart\"\n"
"    />\n"
msgstr ""
"<CardGroup>\n"
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Estimator\"\n"
"      description=\"Kinakalkula ang mga expectation value para sa isa o higit pang mga observable na may kaugnayan sa mga state na inihanda ng mga quantum circuit. May built-in na mga pamamaraan ng error suppression at mitigation.\"\n"
"      href=\"/guides/get-started-with-estimator\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Estimator quickstart\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Estimator quickstart\"\n"
"    />\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Sampler\"\n"
"      description=\"Samples the output register from the execution of one or more quantum circuits.\"\n"
"      href=\"/guides/get-started-with-sampler\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Sampler quickstart\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Sampler quickstart\"\n"
"    />\n"
msgstr ""
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Sampler\"\n"
"      description=\"Nag-sa-sample ng output register mula sa pagpapatupad ng isa o higit pang mga quantum circuit.\"\n"
"      href=\"/guides/get-started-with-sampler\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Sampler quickstart\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Sampler quickstart\"\n"
"    />\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"        <Card\n"
"      title=\"Executor (beta)\"\n"
"      description=\"Samples output registers from quantum circuit executions based on input directives and gives you full control and transparency over customizing error mitigation methods.\"\n"
"      href=\"/guides/get-started-with-executor\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Executor quickstart\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Executor quickstart\"\n"
"    />\n"
"</CardGroup>\n"
msgstr ""
"        <Card\n"
"      title=\"Executor (beta)\"\n"
"      description=\"Nag-sa-sample ng mga output register mula sa mga quantum circuit execution batay sa mga input directive at nagbibigay sa iyo ng buong kontrol at transparency sa pag-customize ng mga pamamaraan ng error mitigation.\"\n"
"      href=\"/guides/get-started-with-executor\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Executor quickstart\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Executor quickstart\"\n"
"    />\n"
"</CardGroup>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Mga susunod na hakbang {#next-steps}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"- Learn about the [Qiskit primitives](/guides/primitives) that the Qiskit Runtime primitives are based on.\n"
"- Review detailed [Estimator](/guides/estimator-examples), [Sampler](/guides/sampler-examples), or [Executor](/guides/executor-examples) examples.\n"
"- See the input and output details for [Estimator](/guides/estimator-input-output), [Executor](/guides/executor-input-output), and [Sampler](/guides/sampler-input-output).\n"
"- Practice with primitives by working through the [Cost function lesson](/learning/courses/variational-algorithm-design/cost-functions) in IBM Quantum Learning.\n"
"- See the [EstimatorV2 API reference](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/estimator-v2), [SamplerV2 API reference](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/sampler-v2), and [Executor API reference](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/executor).\n"
"- Read [Migrate to V2 primitives](/guides/v2-primitives).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Mga rekomendasyon\">\n"
"- Matuto tungkol sa [Qiskit primitive](/guides/primitives) na pinagbasehan ng Qiskit Runtime primitive.\n"
"- Suriin ang mga detalyadong halimbawa ng [Estimator](/guides/estimator-examples), [Sampler](/guides/sampler-examples), o [Executor](/guides/executor-examples).\n"
"- Tingnan ang mga detalye ng input at output para sa [Estimator](/guides/estimator-input-output), [Executor](/guides/executor-input-output), at [Sampler](/guides/sampler-input-output).\n"
"- Magsanay sa mga primitive sa pamamagitan ng paggawa ng [Cost function lesson](/learning/courses/variational-algorithm-design/cost-functions) sa IBM Quantum Learning.\n"
"- Tingnan ang [EstimatorV2 API reference](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/estimator-v2), [SamplerV2 API reference](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/sampler-v2), at [Executor API reference](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/executor).\n"
"- Basahin ang [Migrate to V2 primitives](/guides/v2-primitives).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
